<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Evaluating Multimodal Large Language Models on Core Music Perception Tasks</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Brandon J. Carone
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Pablo Ripollés
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
